[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":164},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":10,"_16":17,"_18":19,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":29},"title","Matching Christmas Pajamas for Couples: 11 Cozy Sets for 2026","slug","matching-christmas-pajamas-couples-2026","category","couple-style","seoTitle","metaDescription","The cutest matching Christmas pajamas for couples: plaid flannel, Fair Isle, fleece onesies and more, plus sizing tips so both sets fit.","image","/images/208dce3d-23a5-4e06-95d7-7bd3b74d310e.webp","imageAlt","A couple wearing matching red plaid flannel pajamas by a Christmas tree","intro","Nothing says \"we are THAT couple\" like matching Christmas pajamas, and honestly, you should be. They make Christmas morning feel like a movie, your photos look 10 times better, and you will wear them all winter long. We picked sets with thousands of happy buyers, sizes for both of you, and fabrics that are actually comfy. Our top pick: the classic red buffalo plaid. Order by early December so you have time to swap sizes.","sections",[75,76,77,78],"comparison",{"_41":42,"_43":44},"faq",[30,31,32],{"_33":39,"_35":40},{"_33":37,"_35":38},{"_33":34,"_35":36},"question","Can we match without the exact same set?","answer","Yes: pick the same color in two fabrics, like red satin for her and red plaid flannel for him.","Are matching pajamas a good Christmas gift for a partner?","Yes. They are personal, useful all winter, and start a yearly tradition.","When should I order matching Christmas pajamas?","In November or the first week of December, so you have time to exchange sizes.","columns",[72,73,74],"rows",[45,46,47,48,49],{"_50":68,"_52":69},{"_50":64,"_52":65},{"_50":60,"_52":61},{"_50":56,"_52":57},{"_50":51,"_52":53},"label","Waffle knit","values",[54,55],"Cold climates, matte look","Thicker, heavier","Satin",[58,59],"A dressier look for her","Not warm on its own","Fleece",[62,63],"The warmest option","Can feel hot indoors","Cotton jersey",[66,67],"Warm sleepers","Less cozy in winter","Flannel",[70,71],"Cold homes, classic look","Can shrink; size up","Fabric","Best for","Watch out for",{"_79":143,"_81":144,"_83":145},{"_79":122,"_81":123,"_83":124},{"_79":101,"_81":102,"_83":103},{"_79":80,"_81":82,"_83":84},"heading","For every climate","text","Freezing winter or Christmas at the beach, there is a set for you. Couple sets are often sold as separate men's and women's listings, so check each size chart.","products",[85,86],{"_87":96,"_18":97,"_90":98,"_92":99,"_94":100},{"_87":88,"_18":89,"_90":91,"_92":93,"_94":95},"name","Best for warm places: short-sleeve Christmas set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/10604223/pexels-photo-10604223.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Short-sleeve holiday pajamas","description","Spending Christmas somewhere sunny? Keep the tradition without melting. Short sleeves, same festive vibe.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CK1FMTRB?tag=relations0237-20","Best for cold winters: waffle-knit set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5426052/pexels-photo-5426052.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Waffle-knit sleepwear folded on a bed","Thick, cozy waffle cotton that keeps you warm without feeling sweaty. A grown-up alternative to fleece.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8SLM739?tag=relations0237-20","The extra-special touches","Want to make it a real gift? Go for a coordinated couples set, add your dog to the photo, or pick a set that is ready to wrap.",[104,105,106],{"_87":117,"_18":118,"_90":119,"_92":120,"_94":121},{"_87":112,"_18":113,"_90":114,"_92":115,"_94":116},{"_87":107,"_18":108,"_90":109,"_92":110,"_94":111},"Easiest gift for her: soft long-sleeve pajama set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6976782/pexels-photo-6976782.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Wrapped pajama gift box with ribbon","More than 10,000 reviews mention one thing: it is incredibly soft. A no-fail Christmas gift that she will wear way past January.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGRHDVPR?tag=relations0237-20","Cutest photo: matching set with a pet size","https://images.pexels.com/photos/32949053/pexels-photo-32949053.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Holiday gift box with matching pet outfit","Yes, the dog gets pajamas too. The same print for you, your partner and your pup, and the photo everyone will save.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CKHV1821?tag=relations0237-20","Best his-and-hers set: couples Christmas pajamas","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9451223/pexels-photo-9451223.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Personalized holiday gift with names","Made as a pair, so you do not have to hunt for two matching listings. Easy, coordinated and ready for Christmas morning.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DGGHSYGL?tag=relations0237-20","Cozy, cute and a little bit silly","For couples who take comfort seriously and themselves not too seriously. Onesies for movie nights, satin for a little glam, and family sets when the whole crew wants in.",[125,126,127],{"_87":138,"_18":139,"_90":140,"_92":141,"_94":142},{"_87":133,"_18":134,"_90":135,"_92":136,"_94":137},{"_87":128,"_18":129,"_90":130,"_92":131,"_94":132},"Best for the whole family: matching holiday set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5522896/pexels-photo-5522896.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Folded cozy loungewear in festive colors","When the kids, the parents and the in-laws all want to match. Big group, one print, one unforgettable photo.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFF17H9?tag=relations0237-20","Best for her: red satin pajama set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6487380/pexels-photo-6487380.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Red satin pajamas folded with a gift tag","Almost 20,000 reviews. Smooth, elegant and seriously flattering. Pair it with his red plaid flannel: same color, two textures, and the cutest coordinated look of the season.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089F1LJZ4?tag=relations0237-20","Most fun: Tipsy Elves Christmas onesies","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6405805/pexels-photo-6405805.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Couple in cozy holiday onesies","The warmest, silliest option on the list. Zip in, grab the hot chocolate, and start the Christmas movie marathon. Your photos will be legendary.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076849F21?tag=relations0237-20","The classics (you cannot go wrong)","Red plaid, snowflakes and Christmas prints are classics for a reason: they look amazing next to the tree and in every photo. Flannel can shrink a little in the wash, so most buyers size up.",[146,147,148],{"_87":159,"_18":160,"_90":161,"_92":162,"_94":163},{"_87":154,"_18":155,"_90":156,"_92":157,"_94":158},{"_87":149,"_18":150,"_90":151,"_92":152,"_94":153},"Best lightweight: striped Christmas matching set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/1028741/pexels-photo-1028741.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Light cotton holiday pajamas","Light, festive and breathable. Perfect if your home is warm or one of you always kicks the blanket off.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FN4G6CBG?tag=relations0237-20","Best for photos: Fair Isle family pajamas","https://images.pexels.com/photos/15293999/pexels-photo-15293999.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Couple pajamas with Nordic snowflake print","Nordic snowflake prints that look cozy and grown-up, not cartoonish. They come in sizes for the whole family if you want everyone in the picture.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FG2WNQF9?tag=relations0237-20","Best overall: red buffalo plaid flannel pants","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5522909/pexels-photo-5522909.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","A couple in matching red plaid flannel pajamas","Over 40,000 reviews and the most classic Christmas look there is. Soft, warm and made for coffee by the tree. Get a pair for each of you, or pair his with a red top for her.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y1QQP15?tag=relations0237-20",{"_165":166},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
